      "text": "Guess who almost missed her flight home bc of manila traffic &amp; last minute schedule changes?\n\nMe 🙋🏻‍♀️🤦🏻‍♀️\n\nI don’t wanna go home &amp; go back to work yet. But I’m glad I didn’t miss my flight. 😮‍💨\n\n‘Til next time Manila!\n\nMapuli na ko, Iloilo. See you soon 🤗\n\nPS. That’s my bff’s hand 😁 https://t.co/P5zRRs9viy",
