      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1935000318988755140",
      "text": "[4:39PM] #MobolajiBankAnthonyWay #TrafficUpdate \n\n Along the service lane of Anthony, the journey towards Maryland intersection experiences slow but steady movement, continuing smoothly through Odo Iyalaro. Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way heading inward Custom is clear; however, traffic becomes congested from Custom towards Ikeja proper due to commercial activity on Awolowo Road, Ikeja. Our personnel are present to manage the flow.\n\nMoving towards Kodesoh, the inward journey underneath the bridge is experiencing heavy traffic due to ongoing commercial activities. Conversely, the return journey from Kodesoh towards the LASUTH underpass is currently clear. Oba Akinjobi Ikeja inward towards Police College is flowing freely, but the return journey from Police College towards Kodesoh is busy. \n\nMobolaji Bank Anthony Way heading inward towards Maryland is currently clear.\nBoth the Oba Akran link bridge and the Airport link are reporting good traffic flow at this time. Officers are stationed at various potential congestion points to facilitate movement. No impediments to traffic flow are observed at present. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
