      "text": "[4:48PM] #AjasaCommand #TrafficUpdate \n\n The Megida Ayobo axis extending through Amule and Oluwaga down to the Church roundabout is experiencing smooth traffic conditions at the time of this report. Specifically, the areas of Adefemi, Oju, and the Church roundabout are moving without issue.\n\n However, the vicinity of Command Secondary School is encountering slower traffic due to commercial activities in the area. Furthermore, the Ekoro junction is experiencing slow movement. Our officers are present at this location to manage the flow and mitigate any potential congestion.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
