      "text": "[4:52PM] #Ejigbo #Ikotun  #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement from Ikotun Roundabout through Old Garage outwards is currently smooth. However, the return journey on this route is experiencing slower traffic due to commercial activities concentrated at Ikotun Roundabout.\nSimilarly, traffic along the route from Ikotun Roundabout through Oju Odo, in both inward and outward directions, is moving slowly due to the activities of commercial buses in the area. LASTMA officers are present to manage the traffic flow.\n\nThe route from Synagogue, heading towards Ilewe, Cele Egbe, Power Line, Iyana Ejigbo, NNPC Junction, Mobostic, and inwards Canoe, is currently clear with good traffic flow.\nAt Jakande Roundabout, outward traffic is a little busy due to commercial activities. Our men are on ground managing traffic in this area.\n\nThe return journey from Jakande Roundabout inwards NNPC Junction, down to Iyana Ejigbo, Power Line, Ilewe, and finally to Oju Odo and Ikotun, is currently experiencing good traffic flow with no reported impediments.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
